WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:34.520
=Lady Liberty=

01:35.020 --> 01:37.940
=Episode 8=

02:02.580 --> 02:03.260
Coming.

02:04.580 --> 02:04.940
Mom.

02:06.980 --> 02:08.780
He Han is inside talking to your dad.

02:09.460 --> 02:10.260
When I got here,

02:10.260 --> 02:11.740
your dad wouldn't open the door.

02:12.020 --> 02:13.300
Good thing He Han showed up.

02:13.900 --> 02:14.820
He's so thoughtful.

02:15.180 --> 02:16.970
He never forgets

02:16.970 --> 02:17.980
our birthdays.

02:17.980 --> 02:19.511
Of course. What took you so long?

02:19.533 --> 02:20.660
I've been talking to your dad.

02:20.660 --> 02:21.660
I told you not to come.

02:21.660 --> 02:22.340
Why are you here?

02:22.340 --> 02:22.940
When did you say that?

02:22.940 --> 02:23.660
Yesterday.

02:23.980 --> 02:24.420
Did you?

02:25.260 --> 02:26.020
Go home right now.

02:26.260 --> 02:27.940
Your mom asked me to stay for lunch.

02:28.780 --> 02:29.933
Are you done talking?

02:30.300 --> 02:30.980
If so, leave now.

02:30.980 --> 02:32.180
If not, you have five minutes.

02:32.580 --> 02:33.810
I'm here for your own good.

02:33.810 --> 02:34.740
To lighten the mood.

02:34.740 --> 02:36.140
Isn't it nice to get along?

02:36.300 --> 02:38.020
That's only temporary.

02:38.020 --> 02:39.180
The drama is coming.

02:39.540 --> 02:40.540
You're just in the way.

02:40.780 --> 02:42.020
How am I in the way?

02:42.020 --> 02:43.060
- Getting along...
- Mom.

02:43.200 --> 02:44.420
Something came up for He Han.

02:44.420 --> 02:45.580
- He has to leave.
- I'm fine, Mrs. Lin.

02:45.580 --> 02:46.820
Aren't you staying for lunch?

02:46.820 --> 02:48.300
- Yeah, just a few bites.
- Talk to him later.

02:48.300 --> 02:49.320
Don't give him an attitude.

02:49.330 --> 02:50.500
I have to take your mom home.

02:50.500 --> 02:51.880
- I can take you home.
- The food is ready.

02:51.900 --> 02:52.780
- Food is ready.
- Food is ready. Come on.

02:52.780 --> 02:53.580
Okay, Mrs. Lin.

02:53.580 --> 02:54.260
Just a few bites.

02:54.260 --> 02:55.288
Lunch's ready, Mr. Lin.

02:55.580 --> 02:56.580
You'll hold things up.

02:56.580 --> 02:58.100
They'll be waiting for you.

02:58.180 --> 02:59.180
Let them wait.

03:01.020 --> 03:02.060
Drink less alcohol.

03:02.500 --> 03:03.540
Have some juice.

03:03.620 --> 03:03.900
Okay.

03:04.300 --> 03:06.020
Family together,

03:06.340 --> 03:08.060
healthy and happy.

03:08.260 --> 03:08.980
Isn't it great?

03:09.340 --> 03:09.740
Come on.

03:09.740 --> 03:11.180
I said keep it simple,

03:11.180 --> 03:12.220
but you made a feast again.

03:12.666 --> 03:14.740
You're tired cooking it,
and we're tired eating it.

03:15.140 --> 03:16.780
Can't you ever just relax?

03:17.100 --> 03:18.020
It's a birthday.

03:18.380 --> 03:19.780
You're like this birthday or not.

03:20.820 --> 03:21.220
Dad.

03:21.900 --> 03:22.300
Okay.

03:23.020 --> 03:23.540
You and Mom

03:23.540 --> 03:25.300
don't eat together every day, right?

03:25.740 --> 03:26.980
If you see something you like,

03:26.980 --> 03:27.900
eat more.

03:28.060 --> 03:29.460
If not, don't eat it.

03:30.020 --> 03:30.660
Put up with it.

03:31.220 --> 03:33.140
I worked hard to make extra dishes

03:33.580 --> 03:34.940
so we could finally

03:34.940 --> 03:36.900
have a nice family dinner

03:36.900 --> 03:37.700
and be happy.

03:38.220 --> 03:39.780
Why should he have to "put up with it"?

03:41.540 --> 03:42.100
Come on, eat.

03:42.580 --> 03:43.860
I'll say it again.

03:44.700 --> 03:46.220
Just because you work hard,

03:46.220 --> 03:47.660
doesn't mean we'll be happy.

03:53.940 --> 03:54.620
You should go.

03:56.380 --> 03:57.730
If we really start fighting,

03:57.730 --> 03:58.700
lunch will be ruined.

03:59.860 --> 04:01.180
This isn't fighting.

04:01.180 --> 04:02.940
We're just expressing opinions. Right?

04:03.220 --> 04:04.580
This is great. I love this.

04:04.580 --> 04:05.620
Family together,

04:05.620 --> 04:06.820
talking things out.

04:06.900 --> 04:08.100
It's lively and fun.

04:08.380 --> 04:09.060
Mr. Lin, come on.

04:09.500 --> 04:09.940
Cheers.

04:10.060 --> 04:11.500
Happy birthday. To your health.

04:11.500 --> 04:13.220
And thanks for fixing my erhu.

04:13.940 --> 04:14.780
What erhu?

04:15.180 --> 04:15.700
A new hobby.

04:16.380 --> 04:18.260
He Han appreciates our folk music.

04:19.140 --> 04:20.380
That erhu is a good one.

04:20.844 --> 04:22.020
The resonator was cracked.

04:22.300 --> 04:23.340
Fixing it was no big deal.

04:23.666 --> 04:24.300
Thank you.

04:25.500 --> 04:27.220
Good thing He Han came today. Here.

04:27.660 --> 04:28.180
Eat up.

04:28.266 --> 04:29.360
- Thanks.
- Have some soup.

04:29.380 --> 04:30.380
Mom, let him eat

04:30.380 --> 04:31.300
what he wants.

04:31.300 --> 04:32.977
Mrs. Lin, I'll eat whatever you give me.

04:33.260 --> 04:34.100
She's stubborn,

04:34.460 --> 04:35.660
and has a sharp tongue.

04:35.900 --> 04:36.780
Be patient with her.

04:37.420 --> 04:38.820
Get married soon.

04:38.980 --> 04:39.460
No problem.

04:40.100 --> 04:41.140
We broke up ages ago.

04:41.140 --> 04:42.300
I'm not marrying him.

04:42.300 --> 04:43.980
Fighting out of spite

04:43.980 --> 04:45.220
is perfectly normal.

04:45.420 --> 04:46.420
Aren't you fine now?

04:46.580 --> 04:46.900
Look.

04:47.140 --> 04:49.244
He Han is sitting
right here and eating with us.

04:49.500 --> 04:50.940
Please talk some sense into her.

04:51.300 --> 04:52.460
If things don't work out

04:52.460 --> 04:53.180
with her boyfriend,

04:53.180 --> 04:54.500
she can come back to me anytime.

04:54.580 --> 04:55.700
Do I have a boyfriend?

04:55.820 --> 04:56.620
Can you tell me?

04:57.066 --> 04:58.850
Could you please stop making things up?

04:58.850 --> 04:59.300
He Han.

05:00.500 --> 05:01.900
You shouldn't marry Zhanqiao.

05:02.377 --> 05:03.511
She's not worthy of you.

05:04.540 --> 05:05.220
As a father,

05:05.220 --> 05:06.900
I shouldn't say this.

05:07.260 --> 05:09.220
But as your friend,

05:09.340 --> 05:10.020
your confidant,

05:10.900 --> 05:11.900
I have to be honest.

05:12.533 --> 05:13.340
My dad makes a good point.

05:13.340 --> 05:14.100
I don't mind that.

05:16.180 --> 05:18.060
This new boyfriend He Han mentioned...

05:18.260 --> 05:19.140
What does he do?

05:19.500 --> 05:21.260
An up-and-coming young author.

05:21.377 --> 05:22.500
His writing is mediocre.

05:22.500 --> 05:23.980
But he is quite handsome.

05:24.511 --> 05:26.100
He's probably relying on Lin Zhanqiao

05:26.100 --> 05:27.020
to top the charts.

05:29.380 --> 05:30.980
Don't be fooled.

05:30.980 --> 05:32.220
He might just be using you.

05:32.220 --> 05:33.580
He has natural talent.

05:33.940 --> 05:35.220
He was born to write.

05:36.288 --> 05:37.620
With just a few casual updates,

05:38.020 --> 05:38.700
he can instantly

05:38.700 --> 05:39.900
dominate the top of the charts.

05:45.100 --> 05:45.980
Mom, let me tell you,

05:46.622 --> 05:48.300
I've been in this industry a long time.

05:48.300 --> 05:49.820
A naturally gifted writer like him

05:50.260 --> 05:51.180
is one of a kind.

05:51.580 --> 05:52.740
Absolutely unique.

05:53.500 --> 05:54.260
Top of the charts?

05:54.660 --> 05:56.060
Does he write better than He Han?

05:56.088 --> 05:57.210
That's impossible, Mr. Lin.

05:57.210 --> 05:58.290
I haven't been writing lately.

05:58.290 --> 05:58.890
I'm on hiatus.

05:59.088 --> 06:00.288
Good thing you're on hiatus.

06:00.420 --> 06:01.900
Otherwise, getting crushed by a rookie

06:01.900 --> 06:02.660
would be

06:03.620 --> 06:04.340
humiliating.

06:04.820 --> 06:06.100
Being a good writer

06:06.740 --> 06:08.580
doesn't make him a good boyfriend.

06:08.580 --> 06:09.660
Who doesn't love a genius?

06:09.755 --> 06:11.355
Beauty is in the eye of the beholder.

06:12.060 --> 06:13.050
What's his name?

06:13.050 --> 06:13.540
Gu Yan.

06:14.060 --> 06:14.660
Gu Yan?

06:15.020 --> 06:16.290
That's not a good name.

06:16.290 --> 06:16.780
Right?

06:18.020 --> 06:19.088
Mr. Lin, look at this.

06:19.980 --> 06:20.860
Are you done?

06:24.620 --> 06:25.260
Let me see, too.

06:26.000 --> 06:27.177
What does he look like?

06:28.100 --> 06:28.460
Look.

06:29.711 --> 06:30.980
Everyone is getting along.

06:31.060 --> 06:31.540
Like this.

06:36.180 --> 06:37.300
What were you thinking?

06:37.820 --> 06:39.020
My new boyfriend?

06:39.500 --> 06:40.700
Gu Yan is my new author.

06:40.700 --> 06:42.540
We have a strictly
professional relationship.

06:42.860 --> 06:44.060
You think everyone is like you?

06:44.340 --> 06:45.020
What did I do?

06:45.740 --> 06:46.660
You mean...

06:47.600 --> 06:49.380
You've only known
Dai Shan for a few days.

06:49.500 --> 06:50.820
And you're flirting with her

06:50.820 --> 06:52.060
before you even started working!

06:52.333 --> 06:54.060
Dipping your pen
in the company ink, huh?

06:54.940 --> 06:55.460
Jealous?

06:56.380 --> 06:57.260
I'm not jealous!

06:57.700 --> 06:59.260
I just despise your character.

06:59.940 --> 07:00.500
Dai Shan

07:00.500 --> 07:01.460
is a bit older than me.

07:01.460 --> 07:02.700
She is thoughtful.

07:03.020 --> 07:03.740
She can solve

07:03.740 --> 07:05.260
a problem so calmly.

07:05.380 --> 07:06.700
Girls my age would rather

07:07.020 --> 07:08.488
stick together 24/7.

07:08.555 --> 07:10.420
They throw tantrums
over every little thing.

07:10.420 --> 07:11.700
They threaten
to break up with me.

07:11.700 --> 07:12.420
First of all.

07:13.300 --> 07:14.500
I only spent every day with you

07:14.500 --> 07:15.940
because of work.

07:16.100 --> 07:16.500
Second.

07:16.900 --> 07:17.900
Those "little things"

07:18.060 --> 07:19.888
were the straw
that broke the camel's back.

07:19.940 --> 07:21.688
I put up with you over and over again.

07:22.740 --> 07:23.180
Third.

07:23.733 --> 07:24.740
Even though we used to

07:24.740 --> 07:26.260
break up and get back together a lot,

07:26.260 --> 07:27.888
that was because
I had feelings for you.

07:27.980 --> 07:28.540
But this time,

07:28.980 --> 07:29.820
we broke up for good.

07:30.180 --> 07:31.140
Why so defensive?

07:31.260 --> 07:32.420
I was talking about Mimi.

07:34.980 --> 07:35.740
I know.

07:36.180 --> 07:37.980
Our issues weren't entirely your fault.

07:37.980 --> 07:38.740
I had my flaws, too.

07:39.060 --> 07:40.300
Not entirely my fault?

07:40.300 --> 07:41.140
It was 50/50.

07:47.020 --> 07:48.300
Thank you for today.

07:49.100 --> 07:50.180
I appreciate your kindness.

07:50.460 --> 07:52.140
But you keep coming after we broke up.

07:52.380 --> 07:53.530
I hate that.

07:53.530 --> 07:55.130
I always have a reason for finding you.

07:55.140 --> 07:56.820
Even though we broke up,
if I see an issue,

07:56.820 --> 07:57.900
I still have a responsibility

07:57.900 --> 07:58.540
to warn you.

07:58.740 --> 07:59.660
Just like today.

07:59.900 --> 08:00.860
Right? It's no big deal.

08:00.860 --> 08:01.780
Thank you for that.

08:02.300 --> 08:03.460
Never do it again.

08:03.740 --> 08:04.340
Lin Zhanqiao.

08:04.340 --> 08:06.377
Do we have some deep-seated
hatred for each other?

08:06.780 --> 08:08.540
Is there a need to cut each other off?

08:10.220 --> 08:11.140
Unless you admit

08:11.820 --> 08:13.020
you can't let me go.

08:13.020 --> 08:14.660
Seeing me still messes
with your emotions.

08:14.660 --> 08:15.460
I admit it.

08:15.780 --> 08:16.900
I still care about you a lot.

08:17.260 --> 08:18.540
You already have a girlfriend.

08:18.688 --> 08:20.180
I'm looking for a new boyfriend too.

08:20.420 --> 08:21.940
We should stop talking about this.

08:22.260 --> 08:23.940
Do you really believe
I'm dating Dai Shan?

08:24.020 --> 08:24.820
It's all fake.

08:24.820 --> 08:26.200
That was just to deal with Mimi.

08:26.580 --> 08:27.660
So you and Mimi were real?

08:28.020 --> 08:28.820
I never touched her.

08:37.740 --> 08:38.500
Why are you here?

08:39.820 --> 08:40.620
To pick you up.

08:40.777 --> 08:41.911
Heading back to the office?

08:42.060 --> 08:42.740
I'll take a cab.

08:43.500 --> 08:45.020
Don't look
for a new boyfriend online.

08:45.020 --> 08:45.900
Too many scammers.

09:00.500 --> 09:01.540
You're that worried?

09:01.822 --> 09:03.260
You came all the way to pick me up.

09:04.340 --> 09:05.860
What if you two got back together?

09:06.380 --> 09:07.780
I can lose a boyfriend.

09:08.260 --> 09:09.380
But I can't afford to lose

09:09.380 --> 09:10.620
a star author.

09:11.340 --> 09:12.900
You underestimate yourself.

09:13.180 --> 09:14.500
I bought this car

09:14.500 --> 09:16.580
just to show how much I value you.

09:17.300 --> 09:18.780
It doesn't matter if I look bad.

09:18.900 --> 09:20.340
But you need to look good, right?

09:20.940 --> 09:21.620
Thanks, boss.

09:24.260 --> 09:26.700
Lin Zhanqiao got
Zhiyuan's venture capital.

09:26.900 --> 09:27.740
Did you know?

09:28.540 --> 09:29.180
Good for her.

09:30.780 --> 09:31.860
With just one Gu Yan.

09:31.860 --> 09:32.900
What does that tell you?

09:33.377 --> 09:34.700
That Gu Yan is a heavy hitter.

09:36.340 --> 09:37.610
It shows that this money

09:37.610 --> 09:38.850
isn't for Gu Yan.

09:38.850 --> 09:40.260
It's for Lin Zhanqiao.

09:40.740 --> 09:42.010
By producing a Gu Yan,

09:42.010 --> 09:43.780
she proved her own capability.

09:43.980 --> 09:45.380
She doesn't rely on you,

09:46.380 --> 09:47.740
He Han, to make a career.

09:49.860 --> 09:50.740
On the contrary,

09:51.066 --> 09:52.740
you go on hiatus right
after a breakup.

09:52.900 --> 09:54.100
People are saying that

09:54.100 --> 09:55.820
without Lin Zhanqiao,

09:55.900 --> 09:57.500
you can't write a single thing.

09:57.940 --> 09:59.940
So we need to prove ourselves.

10:01.100 --> 10:02.060
On your first day back,

10:02.860 --> 10:03.620
we need a big win.

10:04.300 --> 10:05.780
Okay. Don't worry.

10:06.460 --> 10:07.460
Revise it.

10:07.580 --> 10:08.200
What is this?

10:12.620 --> 10:13.980
Who made these annotations?

10:14.980 --> 10:16.860
The AI evaluation system I'm using.

10:18.860 --> 10:21.140
Writing a novel based on AI evaluation?

10:23.340 --> 10:24.460
Don't underestimate it.

10:25.180 --> 10:26.500
The developers used

10:26.500 --> 10:29.010
massive amounts of fiction
and reader feedback.

10:29.010 --> 10:30.980
It's proven to predict reader tastes...

10:30.980 --> 10:32.780
A Lotus is a Lotus.

10:33.620 --> 10:35.180
It wasn't created

10:35.180 --> 10:36.500
just by studying

10:36.500 --> 10:37.620
masses of car design data.

10:39.900 --> 10:41.460
You don't have to agree with it,

10:43.060 --> 10:44.300
but you shouldn't ignore it.

10:50.780 --> 10:51.260
Hi, Ms. Lin.

10:51.740 --> 10:52.100
Ms. Lin.

10:56.940 --> 10:57.300
Ms. Lin.

10:57.622 --> 10:58.420
You didn't go back?

10:59.022 --> 11:00.200
Where are you staying?

11:00.620 --> 11:01.780
At a friend's place.

11:02.740 --> 11:04.380
It isn't a long-term solution.

11:05.260 --> 11:05.860
No.

11:06.460 --> 11:08.940
Ms. Lin, life has
no long-term solutions.

11:09.140 --> 11:10.380
Only long-term wandering.

11:12.780 --> 11:14.260
He Han's sentimental lines

11:14.340 --> 11:15.300
are nice to read.

11:15.780 --> 11:16.980
Using them to guide your life

11:17.180 --> 11:17.860
is meaningless.

11:19.380 --> 11:20.580
While you're "wandering,"

11:21.020 --> 11:22.340
others are driving luxury cars.

11:28.580 --> 11:30.020
By the way, He Han asked

11:30.020 --> 11:30.980
if you were here yet.

11:31.180 --> 11:32.580
He has something to drop off.

11:34.377 --> 11:35.420
Tell him not to bother.

11:35.533 --> 11:36.866
I don't need anything from him.

11:41.955 --> 11:43.555
What are you waiting for? Go.

11:47.220 --> 11:48.620
Milk tea is on me today.

11:49.140 --> 11:50.900
Once the investment contract is signed,

11:51.022 --> 11:52.340
we'll celebrate with champagne.

11:52.500 --> 11:52.940
Thanks!

11:52.940 --> 11:53.380
Thank you!

11:53.380 --> 11:54.260
Thanks, Ms. Lin.

11:54.460 --> 11:55.260
You're the best.

11:56.980 --> 11:57.420
Thanks.

11:58.980 --> 11:59.820
The financial strain

12:00.860 --> 12:01.780
and resignations

12:02.900 --> 12:03.900
have made recent days

12:04.300 --> 12:05.580
incredibly tough

12:05.580 --> 12:06.620
for all of us.

12:08.020 --> 12:09.460
We barely had the budget

12:09.700 --> 12:10.860
to sign new authors.

12:13.380 --> 12:14.100
But thankfully,

12:14.660 --> 12:16.580
things are about to change.

12:16.900 --> 12:19.100
So please, get ready to kick off

12:19.100 --> 12:20.220
our next phase of work.

12:20.340 --> 12:20.700
Okay.

12:21.460 --> 12:23.700
Gu Yan is our star right now.

12:24.500 --> 12:25.940
But to be safe,

12:26.111 --> 12:27.330
we shouldn't put all our eggs

12:27.330 --> 12:28.980
in one basket.

12:29.900 --> 12:32.140
Who knows if he'll turn
into another He Han?

12:34.300 --> 12:36.140
Lawyer Bei has included strict clauses

12:36.500 --> 12:37.660
in Gu Yan's contract.

12:37.820 --> 12:39.622
Ms. Lin, don't you think
our line of work

12:39.666 --> 12:41.311
is a bit different from others?

12:41.620 --> 12:42.980
Just suppose

12:43.300 --> 12:45.020
he starts slacking off
or writing garbage.

12:45.020 --> 12:45.460
Then what?

12:45.460 --> 12:47.560
Authors on the rise don't
have the luxury to slack off.

12:47.580 --> 12:48.850
And once they're past that stage?

12:48.860 --> 12:51.060
We make sure we always
have new rising stars.

12:55.700 --> 12:57.244
Mantou will handle the coordination.

12:58.060 --> 12:59.020
Fragile will keep an eye

12:59.020 --> 13:00.022
on the big-name authors.

13:00.220 --> 13:01.180
Scouting for new talent

13:01.540 --> 13:02.511
will be Naobaijin's job.

13:02.580 --> 13:03.740
It might be too much for her.

13:04.822 --> 13:06.977
Zhangzhu, you always
wanted to be an editor.

13:06.980 --> 13:08.100
Why not start now?

13:08.300 --> 13:09.577
Learn the ropes from Naobaijin.

13:10.377 --> 13:11.620
That's amazing! So that means

13:11.620 --> 13:13.020
I can finally work as an editor

13:13.020 --> 13:14.580
and manage my own authors?

13:15.820 --> 13:17.500
Thank you for trusting me with this.

13:17.500 --> 13:18.620
You've got this. Work hard!

13:18.620 --> 13:19.820
Good luck! You can do it!

13:19.820 --> 13:21.800
(Still want the lore book?)
Scouting for rookies is a grind.

13:22.380 --> 13:23.780
Anyway, welcome to the game.

13:24.060 --> 13:25.260
Thank you! Thank you!

13:28.660 --> 13:31.060
♪Please don't let me sense it♪

13:31.060 --> 13:33.420
♪I'm only interested in what's in sight♪

13:33.500 --> 13:35.860
♪Please don't call my name♪

13:35.860 --> 13:38.220
♪I'm still finding
my place in the crowd♪

13:38.300 --> 13:40.700
♪Please don't give me an address♪

13:40.700 --> 13:43.140
♪Let my feet take me where they will♪

13:51.700 --> 13:52.220
Come on in.

13:53.340 --> 13:54.140
I'll stay out here.

13:54.220 --> 13:55.180
Just bring it out to me.

13:55.420 --> 13:56.500
What are you so afraid of?

13:56.660 --> 13:58.100
No one's inside, I promise.

13:58.100 --> 13:59.220
No men or women.

14:04.111 --> 14:06.100
I offered to bring it to you,
but you refused.

14:06.340 --> 14:07.700
Now you had to come here for it.

14:09.820 --> 14:10.900
Come in for some tea

14:10.900 --> 14:11.740
and thank me.

14:12.180 --> 14:13.580
It wasn't easy finding this for you.

14:14.860 --> 14:15.340
Thanks.

14:15.980 --> 14:17.020
At the end of the chapter,

14:17.660 --> 14:18.820
I'll have Gu Yan write a note

14:18.900 --> 14:20.800
thanking you
for providing the lore book.

14:22.060 --> 14:22.380
You...

14:25.460 --> 14:26.220
Anything else?

14:26.820 --> 14:27.780
Won't you open it?

14:28.060 --> 14:28.940
When I get back.

14:29.460 --> 14:30.460
I'll walk you back, then.

14:36.900 --> 14:37.660
Won't you read it?

14:38.380 --> 14:39.180
Just one look.

14:39.180 --> 14:40.180
Just a glimpse is fine.

14:40.380 --> 14:40.780
It's done

14:41.660 --> 14:42.220
in no time.

14:44.020 --> 14:44.660
Go on.

14:44.780 --> 14:46.220
I worked so hard

14:46.220 --> 14:46.900
to get this.

14:47.220 --> 14:48.220
What's wrong with it?

14:48.220 --> 14:49.420
Why are you following me?

14:49.900 --> 14:51.100
You'd know if you looked at it.

14:53.580 --> 14:54.140
Still no?

14:54.420 --> 14:54.860
Impressive.

14:55.180 --> 14:55.540
Fine.

15:02.500 --> 15:03.980
I have other things
to take care of.

15:04.300 --> 15:04.780
Thank you.

15:05.180 --> 15:06.220
I know what's inside.

15:06.340 --> 15:07.380
Thank me after you look.

15:07.380 --> 15:08.100
Then, I'll go.

15:09.980 --> 15:10.460
Mr. He...

15:11.820 --> 15:12.540
For real?

15:12.620 --> 15:13.688
It'll only take a minute.

15:28.260 --> 15:29.488
I thought this was gone.

15:30.180 --> 15:30.980
Fine, I've looked.

15:31.860 --> 15:32.380
Leave now.

15:40.900 --> 15:41.380
Wait.

15:52.780 --> 15:54.140
You said we couldn't enter Guazhou.

15:54.260 --> 15:55.540
You insisted on it.

16:05.660 --> 16:06.740
Is this a new map you made?

16:07.740 --> 16:08.260
Who else?

16:08.933 --> 16:10.955
But you said
that entering Guazhou would ruin

16:11.180 --> 16:12.220
the rest of the story.

16:13.660 --> 16:14.620
How did you get the map?

16:14.780 --> 16:16.780
I meant it was a bad idea for Gu Yan.

16:17.180 --> 16:19.020
If I write it,
I can definitely find a way.

16:19.860 --> 16:20.900
It's interesting, right?

16:21.380 --> 16:22.500
I marked the stages for you.

16:22.580 --> 16:23.220
I see that.

16:29.220 --> 16:29.740
So...

16:30.600 --> 16:32.622
Don't you think you should thank me?

16:38.780 --> 16:40.155
I honestly didn't expect you

16:41.060 --> 16:43.100
to help out with Gu Yan's story.

16:43.540 --> 16:44.940
I've got nothing but time.

16:45.740 --> 16:46.460
Sure, I could be

16:46.460 --> 16:47.644
doing plenty of other things,

16:47.660 --> 16:48.340
but I figured

16:48.660 --> 16:50.060
the bond always remains.

16:50.200 --> 16:52.020
Besides, your parents
were always good to me.

16:52.140 --> 16:53.511
And I suppose it's possible

16:53.555 --> 16:55.100
I wasted a bit of your youth.

16:55.100 --> 16:56.666
But, you have to
take some blame too.

16:56.755 --> 16:57.533
Either way,

16:57.620 --> 16:58.460
it was no trouble.

16:58.860 --> 16:59.700
I'm happy to help.

17:00.444 --> 17:06.155
♪If the sky and the sea
turned upside down♪

17:07.580 --> 17:08.220
Thank you.

17:12.022 --> 17:12.977
You're welcome.

17:17.460 --> 17:18.490
Are you moved?

17:18.490 --> 17:20.620
Do you regret being
so mean and cold to me earlier?

17:20.620 --> 17:21.660
What are you really after?

17:23.540 --> 17:24.300
"Drunk Old Friend"

17:24.300 --> 17:25.540
is a story we wrote together.

17:26.822 --> 17:28.622
Even if you're giving it to Gu Yan,

17:28.900 --> 17:30.460
I don't want to see it become a mess.

17:30.460 --> 17:32.460
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

17:32.460 --> 17:34.222
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

17:34.666 --> 17:35.340
Anything else?

17:35.340 --> 17:36.620
Let him realize his limits.

17:37.066 --> 17:38.420
Not every hill can be overcome.

17:38.500 --> 17:39.100
And?

17:39.888 --> 17:43.666
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

17:44.822 --> 17:48.511
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

17:48.740 --> 17:49.980
I gave him such a great story,

17:51.140 --> 17:52.700
a perfect way to break the deadlock,

17:53.100 --> 17:54.100
and even you,

17:55.020 --> 17:56.860
a brilliant editor.

17:59.620 --> 18:00.660
If he can't write it well,

18:02.420 --> 18:03.540
won't you be disappointed?

18:13.500 --> 18:14.660
Just ask me anything.

18:14.820 --> 18:16.420
I'll tell you everything I know.

18:22.400 --> 18:24.949
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

18:24.950 --> 18:26.729
♪Running in opposite ways♪

18:26.730 --> 18:29.333
♪Searching all along the way♪

18:31.580 --> 18:33.140
(He Han is just like he used to be.)

18:34.088 --> 18:36.022
(One moment
he's dousing me with ice water,)

18:37.180 --> 18:38.940
(the next,
he's making my heart bloom.)

18:41.711 --> 18:42.660
(After the breakup,)

18:43.444 --> 18:44.900
(I'm learning to desensitize.)

18:45.066 --> 18:47.439
♪In another time and space♪

18:47.440 --> 18:50.800
♪We'll stay and walk together
till we grow old♪

18:50.860 --> 18:52.740
(Guazhou)

18:52.740 --> 18:53.980
(Use jade to open the door.)

18:53.980 --> 18:55.860
(Break the seal.)

18:55.860 --> 18:58.740
(Search for Buddhist artifacts.)

19:11.622 --> 19:12.755
What are you doing?

19:14.740 --> 19:15.620
Mr. He Han.

19:16.580 --> 19:17.620
Using the office as a dorm?

19:18.400 --> 19:19.580
Is this place even livable?

19:19.580 --> 19:20.340
It's so unsafe.

19:20.340 --> 19:22.060
What if something falls and hits you?

19:22.780 --> 19:23.900
There is no ventilation.

19:23.900 --> 19:25.340
You're breathing in all this dust.

19:28.700 --> 19:29.060
I...

19:29.820 --> 19:30.300
just...

19:30.940 --> 19:32.180
It's only for a few days.

19:32.780 --> 19:34.340
Once I find a roommate,

19:34.340 --> 19:35.260
I'll move out.

19:37.622 --> 19:39.300
Pack your things and come with me.

19:40.500 --> 19:40.820
What?

19:41.060 --> 19:42.088
You need a place to stay.

19:42.420 --> 19:43.460
Just stay at my place.

19:43.780 --> 19:45.300
It's the least I can do for a fan.

19:45.940 --> 19:47.620
No, no. That's not right.

19:48.540 --> 19:49.460
You stay at a hotel.

19:50.820 --> 19:52.340
You're at a hotel...

19:52.780 --> 19:54.140
How can I go there with you?

19:54.460 --> 19:56.100
No, this is totally inappropriate.

19:56.780 --> 19:57.060
I...

19:57.700 --> 19:59.220
That place isn't right for me.

20:00.900 --> 20:02.020
"That place"?

20:03.000 --> 20:03.980
What are you thinking?

20:04.380 --> 20:05.460
You read too many novels?

20:05.820 --> 20:07.420
Do you think I'm some kind of creep?

20:07.940 --> 20:09.380
Sure, I like pretty girls.

20:09.380 --> 20:10.660
That's because I'm a normal man.

20:10.660 --> 20:11.860
It doesn't mean I'm a pervert.

20:12.180 --> 20:13.740
I'm almost your father's age.

20:13.977 --> 20:16.060
Though I guess
that doesn't mean much these days.

20:16.140 --> 20:17.860
Plenty of creeps
are older than your dad.

20:17.955 --> 20:19.577
- Maybe even your own dad...
- No, no!

20:19.644 --> 20:21.180
Mr. He Han, you're my idol.

20:22.100 --> 20:24.340
How could I ever think you were...

20:25.620 --> 20:26.220
A creep?

20:26.580 --> 20:28.980
Look, that hotel room

20:29.420 --> 20:30.700
is expensive. I can't afford it.

20:30.700 --> 20:31.900
I don't want
to ask my dad for money.

20:31.900 --> 20:33.420
Is that all?
That's not a problem.

20:33.900 --> 20:34.980
I'm a VIP there.

20:34.980 --> 20:36.300
I have plenty of points saved up.

20:36.500 --> 20:37.600
I can use those points.

20:39.060 --> 20:40.220
If it makes you feel better,

20:40.300 --> 20:41.930
pay me what a hostel costs.

20:41.930 --> 20:43.060
How about thirty yuan a day?

20:44.180 --> 20:45.220
Thirty yuan?

20:45.580 --> 20:46.220
Fine, twenty?

20:46.380 --> 20:46.700
No.

20:47.260 --> 20:48.460
Thirty yuan is way too little.

20:48.460 --> 20:50.500
It's fine.
It's not like you're making a fortune.

20:51.100 --> 20:52.290
Enough, it's settled.

20:52.290 --> 20:53.500
Leave that junk behind.

20:56.780 --> 20:58.770
Come on. You just said I was your idol.

20:58.770 --> 20:59.980
Will you listen to your idol?

21:00.500 --> 21:01.711
Stop stalling and let's go.

21:17.940 --> 21:18.620
You'll stay here.

21:19.660 --> 21:20.688
I'm right next door.

21:22.020 --> 21:24.340
Do you usually write in your room,

21:24.340 --> 21:25.500
or at the café downstairs?

21:26.200 --> 21:27.180
Depends on my mood.

21:27.420 --> 21:28.500
I'm on a break anyway.

21:29.860 --> 21:30.780
If you need anything,

21:30.860 --> 21:31.860
just call the front desk.

21:32.260 --> 21:33.180
Thirty yuan a day.

21:33.260 --> 21:34.540
Just wire it to me every Monday.

21:35.644 --> 21:36.300
Get some rest.

21:36.780 --> 21:37.180
Okay.

21:40.780 --> 21:41.460
One more thing.

21:44.377 --> 21:46.377
Don't tell your boss
you're staying here.

21:48.500 --> 21:48.940
Okay.

21:51.620 --> 21:52.660
Thank you, Mr. He Han.

21:58.780 --> 22:00.380
(Transferring funds to
"Great He Han")

22:10.900 --> 22:11.700
Are you Ms. Zhou?

22:12.220 --> 22:12.540
Yes.

22:12.540 --> 22:13.244
Delivery for you.

22:13.980 --> 22:14.460
Thank you.

22:41.860 --> 22:47.260
(As you grow stronger,
the past will seem smaller.)

23:46.540 --> 23:50.340
(As you grow stronger,
the past will seem smaller.)

24:06.020 --> 24:07.822
Hey, just got off work?

24:09.860 --> 24:10.460
I'm so sorry

24:10.460 --> 24:11.690
you have to see the house now.

24:11.690 --> 24:12.488
Take your time.

24:13.140 --> 24:13.580
No worries.

24:14.180 --> 24:15.100
Look, young lady.

24:15.980 --> 24:16.620
You know

24:16.860 --> 24:18.222
the market is rough right now.

24:19.340 --> 24:21.300
Normally, if you weren't in a rush,

24:21.780 --> 24:23.260
I wouldn't suggest selling yet.

24:24.500 --> 24:25.355
It's an emergency.

24:27.020 --> 24:28.066
If you're in a rush,

24:28.222 --> 24:29.660
you're not going to get top money.

24:31.140 --> 24:32.980
I need at least seven million.

24:34.580 --> 24:35.940
With this interior?

24:36.377 --> 24:37.622
I think 6.3 million is fine.

24:37.777 --> 24:38.844
If we wait a bit,

24:39.060 --> 24:39.980
it might be possible.

24:40.266 --> 24:40.933
I can't wait.

24:42.300 --> 24:43.500
How about a month?

24:44.260 --> 24:44.820
A week.

24:46.060 --> 24:46.820
Impossible.

24:50.580 --> 24:51.460
Seven million net.

24:51.740 --> 24:52.780
We split the extra 60/40.

25:01.020 --> 25:01.820
So, 6.3 million?

25:02.500 --> 25:03.780
I could try to push for that.

25:04.460 --> 25:04.940
Well?

25:12.740 --> 25:13.980
Let me think about it.

25:14.740 --> 25:16.020
Sure. Go ahead and eat.

25:16.460 --> 25:17.580
Call me when you've decided.

25:18.140 --> 25:18.620
Take care.

25:18.777 --> 25:19.711
I'll head out then.

25:36.140 --> 25:39.740
(7:42 PM, Zhao Lanxin:
Are you free tonight?)

25:54.100 --> 25:54.780
Why are you here?

25:55.660 --> 25:57.060
You never replied to my text.

25:58.820 --> 26:00.420
I was worried about you after today.

26:01.740 --> 26:02.260
Come on in.

26:14.380 --> 26:15.740
You're an independent,

26:15.940 --> 26:16.940
successful adult now.

26:18.940 --> 26:19.900
You're not

26:21.460 --> 26:22.540
that helpless child

26:22.900 --> 26:23.940
under her thumb anymore.

26:26.660 --> 26:28.260
She doesn't have power over you now.

26:30.220 --> 26:31.420
Whatever you love,

26:32.800 --> 26:34.088
it's okay to love it.

26:47.020 --> 26:48.500
This is your favorite color.

26:50.140 --> 26:51.740
You deserve the most beautiful colors,

26:53.100 --> 26:54.100
the best clothes,

26:55.260 --> 26:55.820
and jewelry.

26:57.140 --> 26:57.580
All of it.

27:00.100 --> 27:00.740
You deserve

27:02.111 --> 27:03.800
to be more beautiful than anyone.

27:12.620 --> 27:13.620
Can you paint nails?

27:14.260 --> 27:14.820
Not really.

27:17.020 --> 27:18.340
But I'm willing to try for you.

28:11.700 --> 28:12.740
(Guazhou)

28:12.740 --> 28:14.460
(Underground Black Market)

28:14.460 --> 28:15.500
(The Flaming Arena)

28:15.500 --> 28:16.300
What do you think?

28:18.220 --> 28:19.180
It looks really useful.

28:20.940 --> 28:22.100
But He Han wrote this.

28:22.540 --> 28:23.260
Can I use it?

28:23.580 --> 28:24.380
Of course.

28:24.800 --> 28:26.022
Not only can you use it,

28:26.340 --> 28:27.860
you should write down any questions

28:27.860 --> 28:29.500
you have about the plot.

28:29.820 --> 28:31.380
I'll take them to him for a Q&A session.

28:31.780 --> 28:32.700
Is he joking?

28:33.700 --> 28:34.380
He said that,

28:34.555 --> 28:35.844
so I take it seriously.

28:39.980 --> 28:40.460
Forget it.

28:41.740 --> 28:42.660
I'm not him.

28:43.420 --> 28:44.500
If I write his story,

28:45.140 --> 28:46.140
it has to be done my way.

28:47.580 --> 28:48.340
Keep an open mind.

28:48.755 --> 28:50.060
Yours or his, it doesn't matter.

28:50.300 --> 28:51.340
Just go with the best idea.

28:53.020 --> 28:55.500
What if he's leading me
in the wrong direction?

28:55.500 --> 28:56.020
What, then?

28:56.140 --> 28:56.580
He won't.

28:57.260 --> 28:58.540
He's too proud for that.

28:58.540 --> 28:59.860
He doesn't play petty games.

29:01.060 --> 29:02.380
What he really wants is

29:02.660 --> 29:04.580
to hand you the blueprint,

29:04.740 --> 29:06.755
and still have
the readers prefer him over you.

29:10.180 --> 29:10.900
You don't buy it.

29:16.540 --> 29:16.900
Fine.

29:17.540 --> 29:18.380
I'll finish eating

29:18.380 --> 29:19.420
and write some questions.

29:29.860 --> 29:30.540
Needed upstairs?

29:31.620 --> 29:33.140
I said I'm not doing the raid.

29:36.580 --> 29:38.570
Everyone, get in position!

29:38.570 --> 29:39.940
Why are you just standing there?

29:40.700 --> 29:42.540
Team 1 healers, hurry up!

29:42.540 --> 29:44.260
Don't just stand there!
Group up and push!

29:44.260 --> 29:45.700
Throw your items right at the start!

29:45.780 --> 29:46.860
Don't just charge in alone.

29:46.860 --> 29:48.060
Is this your first day playing?

29:48.060 --> 29:48.740
Tell me!

29:49.540 --> 29:51.020
Hurry up, Team 1! Team 1!

29:51.020 --> 29:52.155
I'm talking to you, Team 1!

29:52.380 --> 29:53.940
Hurry up, don't just stay there.

29:54.400 --> 29:55.740
Let me take over. Take a break.

29:56.180 --> 29:57.540
Healers, heal! DPS, focus!

29:57.540 --> 29:58.820
What are you all staring at?

29:58.820 --> 30:00.300
Do you want a red-carpet welcome?

30:00.820 --> 30:01.500
I've had it.

30:01.500 --> 30:03.140
Not one player is doing their job.

30:03.260 --> 30:04.780
Know your positions!

30:04.780 --> 30:05.820
Get into your positions!

30:05.940 --> 30:06.860
Stop standing there!

30:06.860 --> 30:08.160
Does no one know their job?

30:14.940 --> 30:15.490
What?

30:15.490 --> 30:16.200
Come outside. Now.

30:16.300 --> 30:17.066
What's your problem?

30:17.180 --> 30:17.780
Get upstairs.

30:17.780 --> 30:19.700
I told you, I'm busy today.
I'm not going.

30:19.820 --> 30:21.020
Oh, so you just decide that

30:21.220 --> 30:22.380
like you rule the world?

30:23.020 --> 30:24.020
There's work at the cafe.

30:24.020 --> 30:25.290
We're dealing with the cafe first.

30:25.290 --> 30:25.770
Let's go.

30:25.780 --> 30:26.060
You...

30:26.177 --> 30:27.260
What has gotten into you?

30:27.260 --> 30:28.500
I said I'm not going!

30:28.777 --> 30:30.460
Since when do you get to boss me around?

30:30.540 --> 30:31.940
Since you lost your conscience!

30:32.020 --> 30:32.860
Alright, sorry.

30:33.060 --> 30:33.860
Please calm down.

30:34.355 --> 30:35.820
I don't care who calls the shot here.

30:36.140 --> 30:37.020
But I promise you,

30:37.020 --> 30:38.100
I only need one hour.

30:38.340 --> 30:39.100
Once I finish up

30:39.100 --> 30:40.420
the work with him, I'll leave.

30:40.620 --> 30:41.100
Ms. Lin.

30:41.620 --> 30:42.900
You'd better stay out of this.

30:43.660 --> 30:44.420
Wang Hai, listen.

30:44.688 --> 30:46.088
You need to think about

30:46.155 --> 30:47.111
what really matters.

30:47.180 --> 30:47.980
Now, get upstairs.

30:48.140 --> 30:48.380
Move.

30:48.460 --> 30:49.940
I'm not going! Just go back!

30:50.060 --> 30:50.540
- Let's go.
- What are you doing?

30:50.540 --> 30:51.420
- Go back!
- Stop it!

30:51.420 --> 30:53.422
Who told you to come down?
Get back up there. Move.

30:53.500 --> 30:55.060
Why are you grabbing me? Grab him!

30:55.420 --> 30:56.620
He's acting so high and mighty.

30:56.620 --> 30:57.540
Take it out on him!

30:57.644 --> 30:59.500
I'm angry
because you're always making trouble!

30:59.620 --> 31:00.300
Get upstairs. Now.

31:01.060 --> 31:01.580
Go!

31:02.100 --> 31:02.620
Let's go!

31:03.660 --> 31:04.740
Fine!

31:04.940 --> 31:06.022
Stop pulling. I can walk.

31:06.140 --> 31:07.460
I'm done with this. I'm done.

31:10.780 --> 31:11.980
I'm sorry for the scene.

31:13.622 --> 31:14.777
It's fine. How about it?

31:15.060 --> 31:15.780
I'll head out.

31:15.780 --> 31:17.220
We're done for today anyway.

31:18.020 --> 31:18.660
And...

31:19.500 --> 31:20.380
read the lore book

31:20.380 --> 31:21.780
and get back to me tomorrow.

31:22.740 --> 31:23.500
Sorry, San Mei.

31:24.140 --> 31:25.020
You two need to

31:25.180 --> 31:26.620
sit down and talk this through.

31:26.630 --> 31:27.730
Whether online novels or gaming,

31:27.730 --> 31:28.900
you need to decide your path.

31:31.620 --> 31:32.300
I'll see you out.

31:41.100 --> 31:41.700
I'm sorry.

31:42.820 --> 31:44.020
It was bound to happen.

31:44.460 --> 31:45.380
Better now than later.

31:47.020 --> 31:47.660
My ride's here.

31:47.860 --> 31:48.580
Head back inside.

32:25.220 --> 32:25.820
I'm so sorry.

32:27.620 --> 32:28.820
I'll have Er Jiu apologize.

32:33.100 --> 32:33.740
Stop playing.

32:34.460 --> 32:35.260
Go to bed.

32:35.580 --> 32:36.420
Forget the practice.

32:37.820 --> 32:38.580
I'm logging on.

32:39.420 --> 32:40.020
Wait.

32:40.580 --> 32:41.500
Let the DPS lead.

32:42.020 --> 32:42.844
Healers, stay back.

32:43.060 --> 32:44.300
Just focus on the heals.

32:56.860 --> 32:57.580
On your left.

33:53.100 --> 33:56.700
(4:35 AM)
(Zhou Mei: Just woke up.)

33:56.700 --> 33:59.500
(You left at 3:00 AM?)

34:13.660 --> 34:14.260
Hello.

34:25.820 --> 34:26.780
And you are?

34:27.540 --> 34:28.377
Where's He Han?

34:29.900 --> 34:31.540
He's up. In the bedroom.

34:50.300 --> 34:51.380
That girl out there...

34:51.380 --> 34:52.540
Wait. It's not like that.

34:52.620 --> 34:54.420
That's Lin Zhanqiao's assistant.

34:55.300 --> 34:57.660
You've taken
Lin Zhanqiao's assistant, too?

34:58.780 --> 34:59.940
Is this revenge against her?

35:00.420 --> 35:02.540
Stop talking nonsense. I said no.

35:03.100 --> 35:05.300
She had nowhere to stay.
I got her a room nearby.

35:05.300 --> 35:06.860
She asked to have breakfast

35:06.860 --> 35:07.740
and some advice.

35:07.980 --> 35:08.700
That's it.

35:12.100 --> 35:13.820
Does Lin Zhanqiao know

35:15.820 --> 35:17.820
that her assistant is here?

35:18.380 --> 35:19.620
If no one here talks,

35:19.644 --> 35:20.533
she won't find out.

35:21.420 --> 35:22.500
Sorry.

35:26.500 --> 35:28.140
Am I interrupting?

35:28.300 --> 35:28.780
No.

35:29.020 --> 35:29.700
Ready to eat?

35:30.220 --> 35:30.580
Yes.

35:31.180 --> 35:32.460
Is your friend joining us?

35:32.660 --> 35:33.340
No, thanks.

35:33.500 --> 35:34.500
Get her some coffee.

35:34.620 --> 35:35.020
Thanks.

35:35.260 --> 35:35.580
Sure.

35:57.100 --> 35:57.620
He Han?

36:05.380 --> 36:05.900
Coming.

36:06.220 --> 36:07.060
Let's eat together.

36:07.820 --> 36:08.500
Shrimp dumplings.

36:10.740 --> 36:11.660
Zhangzhu, get dressed.

36:11.820 --> 36:12.711
See you at the office.

36:13.044 --> 36:14.711
- Ms. Lin, let me explain.
- Save it.

36:14.900 --> 36:15.740
I'll go.

36:21.580 --> 36:22.340
Lin Zhanqiao!

36:24.780 --> 36:25.380
Sorry.

36:26.900 --> 36:27.340
Thanks.

36:36.500 --> 36:37.780
♪Watch my words come alive in bloom♪

36:37.780 --> 36:39.220
♪Unleash six states in a chain of blows♪

36:39.220 --> 36:40.380
♪See a genius born to soar♪

36:40.380 --> 36:41.940
♪Rising high where the wide skies glow♪

36:41.940 --> 36:43.060
♪If you can catch my shadow♪

36:43.060 --> 36:44.620
♪You can cross the world and roam free♪

36:44.620 --> 36:45.780
♪Your next stop in your heart♪

36:45.780 --> 36:47.340
♪Must be me at the top♪

36:47.460 --> 36:48.460
♪Neon lights glaring bright♪

36:48.460 --> 36:49.980
♪Lighting up every hidden place♪

36:50.180 --> 36:51.660
♪I once climbed rooftops all alone♪

36:51.940 --> 36:52.970
♪Searching for the stars above♪

36:52.980 --> 36:54.300
♪Until I saw your eyes aglow♪

36:54.300 --> 36:55.860
♪Shining through the city lights♪

36:55.860 --> 36:56.340
♪Then I knew♪

36:56.340 --> 36:57.020
♪This was me♪

36:57.020 --> 36:58.540
♪The legend I had chased all along♪

36:58.540 --> 36:59.460
♪Never Stop♪

36:59.540 --> 37:00.380
♪From the city streets♪

37:00.380 --> 37:03.540
♪From the sea of stars♪

37:03.700 --> 37:04.900
♪Never Stop♪

37:05.220 --> 37:06.860
You even came after my assistant.

37:08.860 --> 37:10.340
I thought you hated roommates.

37:10.620 --> 37:11.700
We're not living together.

37:11.780 --> 37:12.660
She's next door.

37:13.820 --> 37:16.130
Think about it. A young girl, homeless.

37:16.130 --> 37:17.420
She's pitiful, right?

37:19.820 --> 37:21.740
I was doing my good deed for the day

37:22.300 --> 37:23.020
anonymously.

37:23.020 --> 37:23.580
Noble, right?

37:24.755 --> 37:25.820
You paid for the hotel?

37:26.180 --> 37:27.220
Of course. She's a fan.

37:27.860 --> 37:28.740
Tell her to move out.

37:28.820 --> 37:29.740
I'll find her a place.

37:30.540 --> 37:31.100
Your place?

37:31.200 --> 37:32.155
Isn't it the same?

37:32.380 --> 37:33.180
Very different.

37:33.580 --> 37:35.220
No. She's still
crashing with someone.

37:36.660 --> 37:38.500
I don't want you to influence her.

37:38.740 --> 37:40.500
I don't want her dad
to lecture me again.

37:41.420 --> 37:42.860
Besides, paying for her room?

37:43.200 --> 37:44.600
People will get the wrong idea.

37:45.740 --> 37:47.300
I'll look after my own assistant.

37:47.660 --> 37:48.420
But thanks.

37:50.644 --> 37:51.360
Don't mention it.

37:51.540 --> 37:52.220
It was nothing.

37:52.820 --> 37:53.850
Glad that's cleared up.

37:53.850 --> 37:54.860
You want to be helpful?

37:55.500 --> 37:56.060
Here's a task.

37:56.580 --> 37:57.020
What?

37:57.740 --> 37:58.860
Didn't you want a challenge?

38:01.620 --> 38:02.900
Gu Yan sure isn't shy.

38:03.177 --> 38:04.900
He's asking for favors
like it's nothing.

38:05.260 --> 38:06.020
He's being polite.

38:06.620 --> 38:07.220
I'm not.

38:09.100 --> 38:09.940
Bring him to me.

38:10.577 --> 38:11.860
I'll coach him personally.

38:11.940 --> 38:12.660
Happy now?

38:18.100 --> 38:18.700
Pajamas?

38:18.700 --> 38:19.580
Hurry up and shoot!

38:19.711 --> 38:20.620
You're a grown man.

38:20.620 --> 38:22.420
Don't be sneaky about it.
Take it properly.

38:23.420 --> 38:24.100
Do a group shot.

38:24.380 --> 38:24.780
Okay.

38:25.140 --> 38:25.860
One, two, three.

38:28.620 --> 38:28.860
Here.

38:28.860 --> 38:30.380
- Thanks, Mr. He Han.
- Thank you.

38:30.380 --> 38:31.060
Okay, bye.

38:31.300 --> 38:32.220
- Bye-bye.
- Bye.

38:34.940 --> 38:35.660
So cool.

38:42.020 --> 38:42.980
Mr. He Han.

38:44.060 --> 38:45.540
I cleared things up with your boss.

38:45.700 --> 38:46.340
Don't worry.

38:47.060 --> 38:48.180
Thank you, Mr. He Han.

38:48.500 --> 38:48.980
Phone.

38:50.100 --> 38:50.700
Phone?

38:52.700 --> 38:53.740
Take your 180 yuan back.

38:54.500 --> 38:55.180
For what?

38:55.700 --> 38:56.220
The room.

38:56.333 --> 38:58.355
You paid for seven days,
but you only stayed one.

38:58.420 --> 38:59.660
Here's the rest back.

38:59.980 --> 39:00.580
We're even.

39:02.300 --> 39:03.980
So, you're kicking me out?

39:04.300 --> 39:04.900
Not me.

39:04.900 --> 39:06.500
Your boss wants you at her place.

39:06.620 --> 39:07.130
Personally,

39:07.130 --> 39:08.620
I think I'm the easier roommate.

39:08.644 --> 39:10.060
Dealing with someone that intense

39:10.060 --> 39:11.580
at work and at home

39:11.580 --> 39:12.700
will drive you nuts.

39:12.940 --> 39:14.200
Take care of yourself.

39:16.500 --> 39:17.740
Thank you, Mr. He Han.

39:43.140 --> 39:43.540
Coming!

39:48.300 --> 39:48.660
Mom.

39:53.888 --> 39:54.533
I'll take that.

40:08.700 --> 40:09.540
About yesterday...

40:10.420 --> 40:11.530
Do you think

40:11.530 --> 40:12.980
I went too far?

40:14.380 --> 40:16.540
Did I embarrass you in front of

40:16.660 --> 40:17.380
your friends?

40:19.300 --> 40:19.780
No.

40:20.380 --> 40:21.020
It's my fault.

40:23.900 --> 40:24.900
At your age,

40:25.420 --> 40:27.620
it's easy to lose your way.

40:28.580 --> 40:29.620
As a woman,

40:30.260 --> 40:31.380
you can't rely on looks

40:31.580 --> 40:33.020
to win over men.

40:34.180 --> 40:36.140
That only leads to misery.

40:36.940 --> 40:37.500
Remember that.

40:38.020 --> 40:39.420
The only thing

40:39.900 --> 40:40.740
that outlasts beauty

40:41.340 --> 40:42.460
is your character.

40:44.900 --> 40:45.540
I'll remember.

40:47.460 --> 40:48.460
Don't think

40:48.580 --> 40:49.740
I'm being too harsh.

40:50.820 --> 40:52.100
When you're my age,

40:52.620 --> 40:54.220
you'll understand.

41:05.300 --> 41:05.780
I know.

41:07.540 --> 41:08.260
Just remember,

41:08.660 --> 41:09.500
everything I do

41:09.980 --> 41:10.940
is for your own good.

41:13.380 --> 41:13.860
I get it.

41:15.660 --> 41:16.580
I can tell.

41:17.580 --> 41:19.580
Those two men from the other day?

41:20.140 --> 41:20.900
They both like you.

41:22.780 --> 41:23.820
But all they see

41:24.140 --> 41:25.140
is your face.

41:26.860 --> 41:27.860
In my opinion,

41:28.140 --> 41:30.220
neither of them is right for you.

41:33.020 --> 41:34.420
That's why I'm not looking to date.

41:37.460 --> 41:38.100
Good.

41:39.100 --> 41:40.300
When you pick a partner,

41:40.940 --> 41:42.020
looks,

41:42.900 --> 41:43.900
status,

41:44.660 --> 41:45.700
and money

41:46.300 --> 41:47.620
don't really matter.

41:48.300 --> 41:50.540
Look at their family background instead.

41:51.980 --> 41:52.540
Remember.

41:52.780 --> 41:53.900
You are a product

41:54.220 --> 41:55.380
of your upbringing.

41:55.660 --> 41:56.620
That's a fact.

42:01.380 --> 42:01.740
Here.

42:02.620 --> 42:03.300
Finish this.

42:04.020 --> 42:04.820
I should get going.

42:05.500 --> 42:07.100
I have a calligraphy lesson to attend.

42:08.860 --> 42:10.060
I had my apple today.

42:37.933 --> 42:38.977
Close the door.

42:39.155 --> 42:39.733
It's okay.

42:39.822 --> 42:40.822
The elevator is here.

43:05.921 --> 43:07.041
(I've been thinking.)

43:08.321 --> 43:11.601
(Everyone's most comfortable level of intimacy)

43:12.361 --> 43:19.691
(is probably different.)

43:20.691 --> 43:22.441
♪If the sky♪

43:22.951 --> 43:24.351
♪And the sea♪

43:24.891 --> 43:26.601
♪Turned upside down♪

43:28.161 --> 43:30.091
♪If a swimming fish♪

43:30.491 --> 43:33.881
♪Fell in love with a flying bird♪

43:35.651 --> 43:37.621
♪If back then♪

43:37.981 --> 43:42.391
♪We had never let go♪

43:42.991 --> 43:49.271
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

43:50.391 --> 43:52.541
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

43:52.541 --> 43:54.411
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

43:54.591 --> 43:57.031
♪And found our way back whole♪

43:57.871 --> 44:00.041
♪So let this surging love♪

44:00.041 --> 44:04.471
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

44:05.371 --> 44:07.551
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

44:07.551 --> 44:08.641
♪That's alright♪

44:09.181 --> 44:09.931
♪If we're buried♪

44:09.931 --> 44:12.631
♪By passing years all the better♪

44:12.891 --> 44:15.071
♪At least we still can keep♪

44:15.251 --> 44:19.671
♪This one eternal photograph♪

44:35.431 --> 44:37.721
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

44:37.721 --> 44:39.481
♪Running in opposite ways♪

44:39.601 --> 44:42.071
♪Searching all along the way♪

44:42.871 --> 44:45.031
♪For the fire of our younger hearts♪

44:45.221 --> 44:50.131
♪And the beauty lost in time♪

44:50.131 --> 44:53.651
♪This time don't lose each other again♪

44:53.891 --> 44:54.861
♪Only after loss♪

44:54.861 --> 44:57.491
♪Do we learn what truly matters most♪

44:57.901 --> 45:00.261
♪In another time and space♪

45:00.261 --> 45:01.821
♪We'll stay and walk together♪

45:01.821 --> 45:04.651
♪Till we grow old♪

45:05.611 --> 45:07.901
♪But still the sky will never♪

45:07.901 --> 45:10.571
♪Turn with the sea♪

45:13.091 --> 45:15.501
♪But still a swimming fish won't♪

45:15.501 --> 45:20.711
♪Fall in love with a flying bird♪
